flowchart LR
    Start([Start]) --> SelectSpec

    SelectSpec[Select existing living feature spec] --> Change

    subgraph ChangeDefinition[Change Definition]
        Change[Change: define bounded delta] --> ChangeAccept[Accept change]
    end

    ChangeAccept --> Plan

    subgraph Planning
        Plan[Plan] --> PlanningAccept[Accept plan]
    end

    PlanningAccept --> Implement

    subgraph Implementation
        Implement[Implement] --> TDDLoop

        subgraph TDDLoop [Red-Green-Refactor]
            Red[Red] --> Green[Green] --> Refactor[Refactor] --> Red
        end

        TDDLoop --> ImplementationAccept[Accept implementation]
    end

    ImplementationAccept --> Sync
    Sync[Sync: update living spec and finalize evidence] --> End([End])
